{"1040028886543872001":{"a":"<p>@RedTRaccoon Without knowing what is in the &quot;gum base&quot; I would assume it&#x27;s poison. Gums interfere with the absorption of sugars in the body (i.e. makes you obese) and cause metabolic issues. Gum base is a blended ingredient they are not required to disclose by FDA.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19628109\">ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19628109</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/RedTRaccoon/status/1040024105666445316\">https://x.com/RedTRaccoon/status/1040024105666445316</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040028886543872001</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1040028886543872001\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-09-13T00:06:24Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1040030214032683009":{"a":"<p>FEMA funding diverted from actual emergencies to fake ones.  Good job! 👍🏻 <a href=\"https://x.com/nytpolitics/status/1039850683770580993\">Tweet by @nytpolitics</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/nytpolitics/status/1039850683770580993\">https://x.com/nytpolitics/status/1039850683770580993</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040030214032683009</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1040030214032683009\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-09-13T00:11:40Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1040034076890214400":{"a":"<p>#truth <a href=\"https://x.com/future_majority/status/1039922080450523136\">Tweet by @future_majority</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/future_majority/status/1039922080450523136\">https://x.com/future_majority/status/1039922080450523136</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040034076890214400