ful memorial to beautiful people. <a href=\"https://x.com/shriners/status/1040337320518606848\">Tweet by @shriners</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/shriners/status/1040337320518606848\">https://x.com/shriners/status/1040337320518606848</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040340369408450561</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1040340369408450561\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-09-13T20:44:07Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1040368642972700674":{"a":"<p>US Exceptionalism? Sorry but uniqueness is all that matters in this universe. I am not you, I am not a Frenchman, I am not a Russian. I am me and you will never convince me to support uniformity and sameness @DrJillStein. You don&#x27;t get to tell me who I am, who we are. We tell you <a href=\"https://x.com/ActMeasuresDoc/status/1040270554593415168\">Tweet by @ActMeasuresDoc</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ActMeasuresDoc/status/1040270554593415168\">https://x.com/ActMeasuresDoc/status/1040270554593415168</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040368642972700674</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1040368642972700674\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-09-13T22:36:28Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1040369709965819905":{"a":"<p>Some artwork for reference.<br>\n<a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1016589839397998592\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1016589839397998592\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1016589839397998592</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1040369709965819905</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1040